        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "一小隊各 職員六人 楽手三人 兵員六十人／いちしょうたいおのおの しょくいんろくにん がくしゅさんにん へいいんろくじゅうにん"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Double-column interlinear note under \"infantry, 4 platoons\": each platoon has 6 staff, 3 bandsmen and 60 rank-and-file. The note is set as two sub-columns, 一小隊各職員六人 on the right and 樂手三人兵員六十人 on the left. 一小隊各 (\"each platoon\") governs all three figures, so the 60 is a per-platoon count, not a domain-wide total; MASTER nevertheless files the 60 as the domain's infantry strength."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
